

Core Functions of Insurance ERP:

Insurance Provider: All information about insurance providers as per Insurance_Provider_Fields.txt file

Insurance Schemes: All information about various insurance schemes as per Insurance_Scheme_Fields.txt file

Policy Management: Track multiple policy types, coverage levels, and renewal dates in one centralized system

Compliance Tracking: Automate documentation and maintain regulatory compliance with built-in industry-specific tools

Claims Management: Streamline the entire claims process from submission to resolution

Client Lifecycle Management: Monitor customer journeys from prospect to policyholder to renewal

Automated Communications: Send timely reminders for renewals, follow-ups, and important policy milestones
